---
layout: layouts/base.njk
section: resorts
pagination:
  data: resorts
  size: 1
  alias: resort
permalink: "/resorts/{{ resort.slug }}/"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{% if resort.fullGuide %}{{ resort.short | safe }} Resort: Quick Facts{% else %}{{ resort.short | safe }}: a first-timer's guide{% endif %}"
  canonical: "{{ resort.fullGuide or '' }}"
  description: "{{ resort.theme | safe }} A plain-English guide to {{ resort.name | safe }} for first-time visitors."
---
{% if resort.fullGuide %}
{% include "partials/resort-quick-facts.njk" %}
{% else %}
{% set tier = tiers | findTierByName(resort.tier) %}
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap page-hero-row">
    <div class="page-hero-copy">
      <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/resorts/">Resorts</a> <span aria-hidden="true">›</span> <a href="/resorts/#{{ tier.slug }}">{{ tier.plural or tier.name }}</a></nav>
      <p class="eyebrow">{{ resort.tier }} resort · {{ resort.area }}</p>
      <h1>{{ resort.name }}</h1>
      <p class="lead">{{ resort.theme }}</p>
      <p class="byline">By [YOUR NAME] · Facts last checked [DATE]</p>
    </div>
    <div class="placeholder hero-photo">[YOUR PHOTO OF {{ resort.short | upper }}]</div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="wrap guide-row">
  <article class="guide">
    {% if resort.dvc %}
    <div class="callout">
      <strong>This is a Disney Vacation Club resort.</strong>
      <p>You don't need to be a member to stay here. Villas range from studios with a kitchenette to multi-bedroom villas with a full kitchen.{% if resort.host %}{% set host = resorts | findResort(resort.host) %} It shares grounds with <a href="/resorts/{{ host.slug }}/">{{ host.short }}</a>.{% endif %}</p>
    </div>
    {% endif %}

    <h2>Our take</h2>
    <p class="todo">[YOUR FIRST-HAND TAKE: what it felt like to stay here, and the one thing a first-timer should know.]</p>

    <h2>Who it suits</h2>
    <p class="todo">[WHO THIS RESORT IS BEST FOR, AND WHO SHOULD LOOK ELSEWHERE]</p>

    <h2>Rooms</h2>
    <p class="todo">[ROOM TYPES, HOW MANY PEOPLE THEY SLEEP, AND WHICH SECTION TO REQUEST. CHECK AGAINST DISNEY'S CURRENT LISTING.]</p>

    <h2>Pools and things to do</h2>
    <p class="todo">[POOLS, PLAY AREAS, AND ACTIVITIES]</p>

    <h2>Where to eat</h2>
    <p class="todo">[RESTAURANTS AND QUICK-SERVICE SPOTS ON SITE, AND YOUR FAVORITE]</p>

    <h2 id="getting-around">Getting to the parks</h2>
    <ul class="ticks">
      {% for t in resort.transport %}<li>{{ t }}</li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p class="todo">[HOW LONG IT REALLY TOOK, AND ANY TIPS]</p>

    <h2>Pros and cons</h2>
    <div class="proscons">
      <div class="card"><h3>Love</h3><ul><li class="todo">[PRO]</li><li class="todo">[PRO]</li><li class="todo">[PRO]</li></ul></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Keep in mind</h3><ul><li class="todo">[CON]</li><li class="todo">[CON]</li><li class="todo">[CON]</li></ul></div>
    </div>

    <h2>First-timer tips</h2>
    <p class="todo">[TWO OR THREE PRACTICAL TIPS]</p>
  </article>

  <aside class="guide-side">
    <div class="card facts">
      <h2>At a glance</h2>
      <dl>
        <dt>Category</dt><dd><a href="/resorts/#{{ tier.slug }}">{{ resort.tier }}</a></dd>
        <dt>Area</dt><dd>{{ resort.area }}</dd>
        <dt>Getting around</dt><dd>{{ resort.transport | first }}</dd>
        <dt>Best for</dt><dd class="todo">[BEST FOR]</dd>
        <dt>Facts last checked</dt><dd class="todo">[DATE]</dd>
      </dl>
    </div>
    {% set nearby = resorts | byArea(resort.area, resort.slug) %}
    {% if nearby.length %}
    <div class="card nearby">
      <h2>Also in the {{ resort.area | replace(" area", "") }} area</h2>
      <ul>{% for n in nearby %}<li><a href="/resorts/{{ n.slug }}/">{{ n.short }}</a> <small>{{ n.tier }}</small></li>{% endfor %}</ul>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    <div class="placeholder" style="min-height:250px">[AD SPACE]</div>
  </aside>
</div>
{% endif %}
